// ★ v3.13.87 — 通用「貼在角色卡片上」技能 GIF helper(任務1 七彩天使神光 / 任務2 神魔滅殺共用)
//   仿 _healGifOnCard/_judgmentGifOnCard:清同 class 舊圖→建 img→確保容器相對定位→append→定時清 src+remove(釋放 iPad GIF 解碼緩衝)
//   opts: { cls(必填,避免互相覆蓋), dur(預設1300ms), opacity(預設0.92), blend(預設normal,治療類可傳 screen) }
function _skillGifOnCard(h, gifUrl, opts){
  if(!h || !gifUrl) return;
  opts = opts || {};
  const cls     = opts.cls || '_skill-gif-fx';
  const dur     = opts.dur || 1300;
  const opacity = (opts.opacity != null) ? opts.opacity : 0.92;
  const blend   = opts.blend || 'normal';
  const el = document.getElementById('card-'+h.side+'-'+h.pos);
  if(!el) return;
  const old = el.querySelector('.'+cls);
  if(old){
    try{ old.src = ''; }catch(_){}
    old.remove();
  }
  const img = document.createElement('img');
  img.className = cls;
  img.src = gifUrl;
  img.style.cssText = 'position:absolute;left:0;top:0;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;pointer-events:none;z-index:200;opacity:'+opacity+';mix-blend-mode:'+blend+';';
  const cs = getComputedStyle(el);
  if(cs.position === 'static') el.style.position = 'relative';
  el.appendChild(img);
  setTimeout(()=>{
    try{ img.src = ''; }catch(_){}
    if(img.parentNode) img.remove();
  }, dur);
}

